Expected Error Message:
If using MySQL, you will receive an error similar to:

**ERROR 1064 (42000): You have an error in your SQL syntax; check the manual that corresponds
to your MySQL server version for the right syntax to use near 'phone_number VARCHAR(20) UNIQUE)'
at line 5**

The Correction:
Simply add the missing comma back at the end of line 4 to resolve the syntax error and run
the query successfully.

```
CREATE TABLE users_error (
    user_id INT PRIMARY KEY,
    username VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
    email VARCHAR(100) UNIQUE NOT NULL, -- Correction: Comma added
    phone_number VARCHAR(20) UNIQUE
);
